gate this ticket.\n\n## Scope\nDocumentation only (the terraform + module code land in story ample-famous-cockatiel). Three artifacts: the gerrit-aws-setup.md subsection, the ADR, and the SSO runbook.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `docs/gerrit-aws-setup.md` documents rebar's ownership of the OIDC provider + the wildcard cert + the auth_host SSO stack, linking the ADR + runbook.\n- [ ] An ADR under `docs/adr/` records the re-homing decision and its tradeoffs (adopt-vs-teardown, import-not-recreate, name preservation, state migration).\n- [ ] An `infra/runbooks/sso-auth-host.md` runbook covers the auth-host architecture, the `/auth-solutions/*` secrets, cookie-key + Google-secret rotation, and the incident revoke lever.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"docs/gerrit-aws-setup.md","reason":"document OIDC ownership + SSO stack"},{"path":"docs/adr/0048-rehome-snap-shared-infra.md","reason":"new ADR"},{"path":"infra/runbooks/sso-auth-host.md","reason":"new SSO ops runbook"},{"path":"infra/terraform/iam.tf","reason":"already fixed stale OIDC comment"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","d58f-7581-1f72-4372"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"d58f-7581-1f72-4372","parent_status_uuid":"4245fd8b-84da-40b2-814a-4eca73dd7f8f","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"6725-32e9-2cf0-4114","ticket_type":"story","title":"Document rebar ownership of the OIDC provider + auth_host SSO stack (docs + ADR + runbook)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["eb0b4e80-7f3d-47ac-b023-ed93f61f2162","d4e63e4c-b248-4282-bed1-5f26aab3201d","514554b0-4193-4253-971e-af108ef0805a","66af983b-f53c-49ef-bf2a-9447b538c1d8","f4df9507-c823-45ec-95a3-e7df54938a5a","19736a48-6c49-4873-bdb3-5964c3306900","f5a583c0-683f-445f-8d6a-303dbd258ad9","32ee994d-f1f6-